 "summary": "A family of nine single Schottky barrier rectifiers rated 3 A average forward current, differing in reverse voltage from 20 V (SS32) to 200 V (SS3200), all in the DO-214AC (SMA) surface-mount package. Each takes an 80 A half-sine surge of 8.3 ms. Maximum forward voltage at 3 A rises with the voltage rating, from 0.55 V to 0.95 V. SS34 is the 40 V member.",
